        LastRefMovers=(What re-aims it in passing. MEASURED: ++ and -- (the walk cursor), a call (runAction). READ, NOT MEASURED: @ aims it deliberately; a by-reference loop source suppresses the iterate writer. MEASURED NOT TO MOVE IT: a bare *argument statement -- C-156 step 3c, lastREF unchanged either side.#);
        LastRefJitRoad=(C-158a, measured 2026-09-04 by reading the .rtn sources. Nine sites, three answers, and the count is TWO HELPER, ZERO EMITTED, SEVEN UNREACHED. Because nothing is EMITTED, no site keeps a second copy of the lastREF write, so a change to the walk writers is a two-line change and not a two-road one.#):
