    ArgBinding=(RULED 2026-09-05 by Tony, VERDICT BUY, out of try-and-buy B. `argument` is a BINDING, not a holder. Inside an action body the name resolves to the PASSED FIELD ITSELF, by address, for the duration of the activation. This is the ONE STATED EXCEPTION to star-every-use.#):
